From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:42:51 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 50/53] Meridian: the member card in Settings; the sidebar
 button
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Settings > General opens with Arc's member card again (as in the Electron
  build): the name, member since, a member number and counts, in the space's
  colours; it tilts toward the pointer with a holographic sheen, and a click
  on the name changes it (kept in the profile; the system's name until then).
- The sidebar's top row starts with the Hide Sidebar button (⌘S), as in Arc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
